markdown <<MARKDOWN
# Prompting Basics

Now that you have set up your first website with HTML, let's talk about prompting. 

Strong prompting skills help them clearly describe the webpage they want to create, ask for useful code, and improve the design of their site.

AI tools can give very different results depending on how a prompt is written. A strong prompt gives the AI enough information to understand the goal, the audience, the structure of the page, and any design requirements.

## Strong Prompt Checklist

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 15px; width: 100%; margin: 20px 0px;">

  <div style="background-color: #F5F7F8; color: #000000; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 2px 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);">
    <p style="font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; margin: 0;">🎯 Is my goal clear?</p>
    <p style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 1.3; margin-top: 10px;">Would someone else know immediately what I am asking for?</p>
  </div>

  <div style="background-color: #F5F7F8; color: #000000; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 2px 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);">
    <p style="font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; margin: 0;">🧠 Did I include context?</p>
    <p style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 1.3; margin-top: 10px;">Does the AI know my situation well enough to help?</p>
  </div>

  <div style="background-color: #F5F7F8; color: #000000; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 2px 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);">
    <p style="font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; margin: 0;">⚙️ Did I set constraints?</p>
    <p style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 1.3; margin-top: 10px;">Are my limits, tools, and preferences named?</p>
  </div>

  <div style="background-color: #F5F7F8; color: #000000; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 2px 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);">
    <p style="font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; margin: 0;">👥 Would a real user understand it?</p>
    <p style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 1.3; margin-top: 10px;">Did I name the person this website is actually for?</p>
  </div>

  <div style="background-color: #F5F7F8; color: #000000; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 2px 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); grid-column: span 2;">
    <p style="font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; margin: 0;">✏️ Am I ready to review and edit?</p>
    <p style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 1.3; margin-top: 10px;">Am I treating the AI response as a draft, not a final answer?</p>
  </div>

</div>

---

## Example Prompts 

**Example 1: Setting up an HTML page**

I am building a beginner HTML website for a school club. Generate HTML for a page with a header, navigation bar, main content area, and footer. The navigation bar should include Home, Events, Photos, and Contact. Keep the code simple and use semantic HTML tags.

**Example 2: Adding content for a real audience**

I am creating a homepage for middle school students joining a robotics club. Write HTML for a welcoming homepage that includes a title, short introduction paragraph, three reasons to join, and a footer with contact information. Use clear text that a student would understand.

**Example 3: Layering in CSS design**

I already have a basic HTML page for a personal portfolio. Write beginner-friendly CSS to make the page look more polished. Add styling for the header, navigation bar, main content cards, and footer. Use readable fonts, spacing, borders, and a simple color palette.

---

<div style="background-color: #B7E0E5; border-radius: 40px; color: #000000; width: 95%; padding: 1px 20px 1px 20px;">

<p style="line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 10px; margin-right: 10px; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 18px;"><b> 💡Teacher Tip: </b>Remind students that different AI bots may produce very different results, even when given similar prompts. Emphasize that strong prompting helps students get more useful starting code, but they still need to read, test, review, and edit the AI’s response before using it in their website.</p>
</div>

## Reminder

As you work through this module, remember: the clearer your prompt, the more useful and accurate the code the AI will generate.
MARKDOWN
